{"id":"ammihud","name":"Ammihud","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:ammihud"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Ammihud","text":"People of glory; i.e., “renowned.” (1.) The father of the Ephraimite chief Elishama, at the time of the Exodus (Num. 1:10; 2:18; 7:48, 53). (2.) Num. 34:20. (3.) Num. 34:28. (4.) The father of Talmai, king of Geshur, to whom Absalom fled after the murder of Amnon (2 Sam. 13:37). (5.) The son of Omri, and the father of Uthai (1 Chr. 9:4)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H5989","lemma":"עַמִּיהוּד","xlit":"ʻAmmîyhûwd","gloss":"Ammihud, the name of three Israelites","kjv":"Ammihud","count":6,"share":0.86},{"strong":"H476","lemma":"אֱלִישָׁמָע","xlit":"ʼĔlîyshâmâʻ","gloss":"Elishama, the name of seven Israelites","kjv":"Elishama","count":3,"share":0.43},{"strong":"H5387","lemma":"נָשִׂיא","xlit":"nâsîyʼ","gloss":"an exalted one","kjv":"captain, chief, cloud, governor","count":2,"share":0.29},{"strong":"H669","lemma":"אֶפְרַיִם","xlit":"ʼEphrayim","gloss":"Ephrajim, a son of Joseph","kjv":"Ephraim, Ephraimites","count":2,"share":0.29},{"strong":"H4294","lemma":"מַטֶּה","xlit":"maṭṭeh","gloss":"a branch","kjv":"rod, staff, tribe","count":2,"share":0.29}],"verses":["Num.1.10","Num.2.18","Num.34.20","Num.34.28","1Chr.7.26","1Chr.9.4","2Sam.13.37"],"related":[{"id":"elishama","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.158,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"elishama","type":"lexical","strong":"H5989","why":"both lead with עַמִּיהוּד (H5989)"},{"id":"beeliada","type":"lexical","strong":"H476","why":"both lead with אֱלִישָׁמָע (H476)"},{"id":"eliphelet","type":"lexical","strong":"H476","why":"both lead with אֱלִישָׁמָע (H476)"}],"works":[]}
